+    This module implements the keyboard boot driver for the Raspberry Pi 2
+    (the ARM FW\MIPS\JXKBD.C) over a USB keyboard in the boot protocol. The
+    reports of the keyboard are polled from the USB host (usb.c), and each
+    key pressed is translated into the keyboard buffer as the Jazz keyboard
+    interrupt translates scan codes (FW\MIPS\FWSIGNAL.C TranslateScanCode).
